artin Summers, and George Aumoithe&nbsp;<\\/p><p><b>October 7th: Understanding Policing and Surveillance in America <\\/b> \\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Victoria Law, Emily Thuma, Stuart Schrader, Daniel Chard\\r\\n   <\\/p>\\r\\n<p><b>November 4th: Education as a Practice of Freedom<\\/b> \\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With Jarvis Givens, Davarian Baldwin, Elizabeth Todd-Breland, and Jesse Hagopian\\r\\n &nbsp;\\r\\n <\\/p>\\r\\n<p><b>December 2nd: Radical Black, LGBTQ+ Feminist Lives:<\\/b>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Barbara Smith, Moya Bailey, and&nbsp;more&nbsp;guests&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;announced\\r\\n<\\/p>\",\"33\":{\"979\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"enabled\":\"1\",\"fields\":{\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"imageasset\":[\"575\"]}}},\"3\":\"\"}}','2021-08-19 23:33:26','2021-08-19 23:33:26','b204870d-eebf-4429-8ba2-3401168fe18e'),(1283,978,2,1,'en_us',2,'','{\"typeId\":\"2\",\"authorId\":\"1\",\"title\":\"Announcing Conversations in Black Freedom Studies Fall 2021 Season\",\"slug\":\"announcing-conversations-in-black-freedom-studies-fall-2021-season\",\"postDate\":1629415980,\"expiryDate\":null,\"enabled\":1,\"parentId\":null,\"fields\":{\"2\":\"<p>We\'re looking forward to welcoming all of our guests and our online audience to an exciting fall season. And we\'re thrilled to welcome Robyn Spencer to the team as co-curator of the series. Mark your calendars, tell your friends and colleagues, and join for these crucial conversations. <br><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>September 2nd: Black Health - Medical Racism, Resistance, and Wellness \\r\\n<\\/strong>\\r\\n <\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With Deirdre Cooper Owens, Stephanie Evans, Martin Summers, and George Aumoithe <\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>October 7th: Understanding Policing and Surveillance in America <\\/strong> \\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Victoria Law, Emily Thuma, Stuart Schrader, Daniel Chard\\r\\n <\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>November 4th: Education as a Practice of Freedom<\\/strong> \\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With Jarvis Givens, Davarian Baldwin, Elizabeth Todd-Brel