90,'field',18,'en_us',' this conversation examines several dimensions of black power then and now jamala rogers explains black power as a protracted struggle against police brutality and killer cops from newark in 1967 to ferguson in the present with photography mark speltz presents a visual history of the black freedom struggle in the jim crow north stephen ward explores the revolutionary love between james and grace lee boggs at the center of detroit s black radicalism komozi woodard presents black power and the bandung west from malcolm x and the black arts movement to yuri kochiyama and the young lords '),(490,'field',13,'en_us',' fergusonisamerica northofdixie inloveandstruggle blackpower50 '),(490,'field',14,'en_us',' jamala rogers mark speltz stephen ward komozi woodard '),(490,'field',19,'en_us',' https www eventbrite com e conversations in black freedom studies black power at 50 tickets 30863421324 '),(490,'field',24,'en_us',''),(490,'field',17,'en_us',' black power at 50 '),(490,'slug',0,'en_us',' black power at 50 '),(490,'title',0,'en_us',' black power at 50 '),(491,'filename',0,'en_us',' angelaleblanc jpg '),(491,'extension',0,'en_us',' jpg '),(491,'kind',0,'en_us',' image '),(491,'slug',0,'en_us',''),(491,'title',0,'en_us',' angelaleblanc '),(492,'field',7,'en_us',' independent scholar '),(492,'field',12,'en_us',' angelaleblanc '),(492,'field',10,'en_us',''),(492,'field',9,'en_us',' angela leblanc ernest gmail com '),(492,'field',8,'en_us',''),(492,'field',11,'en_us',' http independentscholar academia edu angelaleblancernest '),(492,'slug',0,'en_us',''),(492,'title',0,'en_us',' angela leblanc ernest '),(493,'filename',0,'en_us',' tracyematthews jpg '),(493,'extension',0,'en_us',' jpg '),(493,'kind',0,'en_us',' image '),(493,'slug',0,'en_us',''),(493,'title',0,'en_us',' tracyematthews '),(494,'field',7,'en_us',' center for the study of race politics and culture '),(494,'field',12,'en_us',' tracyematthews '),(494,'field',10,'en_us',''),(494,'field',9,'en