d civilians to review complaints against the police which provoked a bitter racially divisive and successful campaign from the police union and its conservative allies to destroy the board this history poorly known until now provides a clear understanding of inequities in employment education housing health and criminal justice that are very much still with us today his teaching is primarily in labor history across time in america with a focus on the development of the institutions and ideologies of race class gender capitalism industry and work '),(510,'field',9,'en_us',' chayes smlr rutgers edu '),(510,'field',8,'en_us',''),(510,'field',11,'en_us',' https smlr rutgers edu faculty staff christopher hayes '),(510,'slug',0,'en_us',' chris hayes '),(510,'title',0,'en_us',' christopher hayes '),(511,'filename',0,'en_us',' cathyschneider jpg '),(511,'extension',0,'en_us',' jpg '),(511,'kind',0,'en_us',' image '),(511,'slug',0,'en_us',''),(511,'title',0,'en_us',' cathyschneider '),(512,'field',7,'en_us',' american university '),(512,'field',12,'en_us',' cathyschneider '),(512,'field',10,'en_us',''),(512,'field',9,'en_us',' cschnei american edu '),(512,'field',8,'en_us',' schneidercathy1 '),(512,'field',11,'en_us',' http www american edu sis faculty cschnei cfm '),(512,'slug',0,'en_us',''),(512,'title',0,'en_us',' cathy schneider '),(513,'filename',0,'en_us',' policepowerraceriots jpg '),(513,'extension',0,'en_us',' jpg '),(513,'kind',0,'en_us',' image '),(513,'slug',0,'en_us',''),(513,'title',0,'en_us',' policepowerraceriots '),(514,'filename',0,'en_us',' civilrightsnewyorkcity jpg '),(514,'extension',0,'en_us',' jpg '),(514,'kind',0,'en_us',' image '),(514,'slug',0,'en_us',''),(514,'title',0,'en_us',' civilrightsnewyorkcity '),(515,'field',5,'en_us',' 2017 05 04 '),(515,'field',18,'en_us',' what are the politics of police brutality in new york city and what leaders and movements have attempted to stop it why don t police review boards stop police brutality clarence tayl